B.Yu=new A.nN("Harooms","Your building, but actually connected","Isn't it strange how you can live in a building full of people and still feel like a stranger? Harooms is a hyperlocal community platform for tenants and owners \u2014 featuring a tenant \u2194 owner communication hub, expense & rent tracking with a P&L dashboard, a hyperlocal buy/sell board (sell only within your building), and community rooms so you can actually meet the badminton squad next door. Built with Flutter + Firebase.","Community \xb7 Mobile & Web App",B.T5,"https://harooms-d0871.web.app/",null,null,B.Q5)
